          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyithindho pa Cefatia, nyithindho pa Hatil, nyithindho pa Pokereth-hazebaim, nyithindho pa Ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Junethini ceke, man nyithindho mi jutic pa Suleman, gi dak adek ku pier abung’wen wi ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi ju m’uidho malu kud i Tel-mela, man Tel-harca, man Kerub, man Adan, manlmer; ento gicopo nyutho udi pa weggi ngo, ku kodhi migi, tek gi mir Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyithindho pa Delaya, ku nyithindho pa Tobia, man nyithindho pa Nekoda, gi dak abusiel ku pier abic wi ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mi nyithindho mi julam ke gi eni: nyithindho pa Habaya, nyithindho pa Hakoz, nyithindho pa Barzilai, m’ugamu dhaku ma kind nyig Barzilai ma Jagileadi, man julwong’e ku nying’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni giyenyo kitabu migi kind ju ma jukwanugi ku thekwaru, ento junwang’ugi ngo: ka kumeno juwacu ya gicido man jukabugi kud i lamulam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 27:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jabim uwacu igi, nia ku gicam kum gin ma leng’ ma sagu, cil ma jalam bicungo ko kud Urim man ku Thumim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.63"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cokri ceke karacelo gi rubanga pier ang’wen wi ario ku dak adek ku pier abusiel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umedo jutic migi ma co ku bong’ migi, mi maeni gi rubanga abiro ku dak adek ku pier adek wi abiro: man gibedo ku juwer ma co ku juwer ma mon dak ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riuni migi gi dak abiro ku pier adek wi abusiel; kana ma tung’ migi, dak ario ku pier ang’wen wi abic; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngamia migi, gi dak ang’wen ku pier adek wi abic; kana migi, gi rubanga abusiel ku dak abiro ku pier ario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.2.67"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
